    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3513" root="بوح" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ بَؤُوحٌ بِمَا فِى صَدْرِهِ</span></b>  <i>He is one who reveals,</i>
or <i>discloses, what is in his bosom;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْحَانٌ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيَّحَانٌ</span>; (K;) the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ى</span> being originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span>.
(TA.)

